---
description: Verification requirements for examples and integrations.
globs: ["**/*.test.ts", "**/*.spec.ts", "**/examples/**", "**/templates/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Test packed/published package behavior, not only workspace source.
- Include a negative test for each authority or validation rule.
- Record exact release, chain, deployment, and ontology profile in fixtures.
- Keep examples synthetic, bounded, and safe to rerun.
- A generated starter is not complete until install, typecheck, tests, manifest validation, and smoke checks pass.
